#. あら、こんばんは。
msgctxt "0001 | CELES"
msgid "Well there, good evening."
msgstr ""

#. セレスさん…
#. 何してるの？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Celeste... What are you up to?"
msgstr ""

#. 何という訳では…
#. 少々、夜の散歩をしていただけですわ。
msgctxt "0003 | CELES"
msgid ""
"What am I up to? I am simply going for a nice evening\n"
"stroll."
msgstr ""

#. そういえば…
#. 亡くなったみなさんのお部屋…
msgctxt "0004 | CELES"
msgid ""
"You know, I was thinking about the rooms belonging to\n"
"everyone who has left us."
msgstr ""

#. どうなっているのか気になったのですが、
#. <CLT 3>扉に鍵が掛かっている<CLT>ようです。
msgctxt "0005 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I would very much like to know what is going on in\n"
"there, but it seems <CLT 3>their doors are locked<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. これもモノクマの仕業…でしょうね。
msgctxt "0006 | CELES"
msgid "It must be another one of Monokuma's little tricks."
msgstr ""

#. あいつ…変なところでマメな事して…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sometimes he gets hung up on the weirdest stuff..."
msgstr ""

#. そうでしょうか？
#. モノクマは熱心なだけですわ…
msgctxt "0008 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Do you think so? It seems that is merely him\n"
"displaying his passion..."
msgstr ""

#. この、コロシアイ学園生活の演出に…
msgctxt "0009 | CELES"
msgid "...toward the production of this killing game."
msgstr ""

#. …………………
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. では、わたくしは散歩に戻りますわ。
#. 苗木君も、お暇でしたらどうです？
msgctxt "0011 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I shall resume my excursion. If you have some\n"
"time, you are welcome to join me."
msgstr ""

#. いや、ボクはいいや…
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, that's okay."
msgstr ""

#. そうですか？
#. では、ごきげんよう。
msgctxt "0013 | CELES"
msgid "Yes? Very well then, goodbye."
msgstr ""

#. そういえば…
#. 亡くなったみなさんのお部屋…
msgctxt "0014 | CELES"
msgid ""
"You know, I was thinking about the rooms belonging to\n"
"everyone who has left us."
msgstr ""

#. どうなっているのか気になったのですが、
#. <CLT 3>扉に鍵が掛かっている<CLT>ようです。
msgctxt "0015 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I would very much like to know what is going on in\n"
"there, but it seem <CLT 3>their doors are locked<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. これもモノクマの仕業…でしょうね。
msgctxt "0016 | CELES"
msgid "It must be another one of Monokuma's little tricks."
msgstr ""

#. あ、苗木君…こんばんは…
msgctxt "0017 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "O-Oh, hi Makoto..."
msgstr ""

#. あのぉ、<CLT 3>倉庫<CLT>ってここだよね…
#. なんでもあるって…石丸君が言ってたけどぉ…
msgctxt "0018 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Umm, this is the <CLT 3>warehouse<CLT>, right? Taka said it had\n"
"everything we could need, but..."
msgstr ""

#. 何か探し物？　手伝おうか？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are you looking for something? You need some help?"
msgstr ""

#. う、ううん。
#. １人で大丈夫だから…
msgctxt "0020 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "N-No, I can take care of it myself."
msgstr ""

#. でも、ありがと…
msgctxt "0021 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Thank you for asking, though."
msgstr ""

#. それじゃあね…
msgctxt "0022 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "So then..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>探し物って…
#. 何を探してるんだろう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wonder what she's looking for...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学校に行ってもしかたないな。
#. <CLT><CLT 3>食堂<CLT><CLT 4>へ行こう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's nothing to do in the school area. I should\n"
"just head to the <CLT><CLT 3>dining hall<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うーん…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここにも食べ物はあるけど…
#. 今は<CLT><CLT 3>食堂<CLT><CLT 4>へ行こうかな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There *is* some food stuff in here, but...for now I\n"
"think I'll just head to the <CLT><CLT 3>dining hall<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あっちの方が新鮮な物が多いし…
#. そういう気分という事で。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm in the mood for something fresh. The dining hall\n"
"has plenty of ready ingredients...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここに食べ物はないな…
#. <CLT><CLT 3>食堂<CLT><CLT 4>へ行こう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no food here. I should just head to the\n"
"<CLT><CLT 3>dining hall<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここに食べ物はないな…
#. <CLT><CLT 3>食堂<CLT><CLT 4>へ行こう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no food here. I should just head to the\n"
"<CLT><CLT 3>dining hall<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここに食べ物はないな…
#. <CLT><CLT 3>食堂<CLT><CLT 4>へ行こう。
#. <CLT>
